cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Autoseq: a Snakemake pipeline for deep targeted sequencing of liquid biopsies"
abstract: >-
  Autoseq is an NGS data-analysis pipeline for very deep targeted
  resequencing of liquid biopsies, which also supports tissue,
  targeted-panel, whole-exome and whole-genome data. It covers QC,
  trimming, alignment, realignment, UMI processing, somatic and germline
  variant calling, copy-number and structural-variant calling, annotation
  with VEP and reporting. It is built on the Snakemake workflow framework
  with Singularity containers and SLURM support.
